       invisible canvas eating a page, and, worst, mostly BLANK, because the
       word-stagger reveal leaves .stagger-word at opacity 0 until its
       IntersectionObserver fires, and content below the fold never has. So the
       reveal guards below aren't polish; without them the printout is empty
       past the first screen.

